<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 258-4 V ENGLAND (172) 4TH TEST - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 258-4 V ENGLAND (172) 4TH TEST - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>LEEDS, England 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were for 258</p>
<p>for</p>
<p>four, a lead of 86, in reply to England's first innings score of</p>
<p>172 at close of play on the second day of the fourth test at</p>
<p>Headingley on Friday.</p>
</text>
